    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183350/extras/99cecb1e534f80541c93e2ee9b7a081f.avif?t=1743563490\" width=650 height=438 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fantasy Aquarium is a casual simulation game that offers card pack openings,capsule toys, and other engaging activities. Players collect fish cards to complete their fantasy fish box. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Game Features </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 The adorable Kanban girl is consistently present by your side.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183350/extras/ad1f1c308e48fa149c925cb0dcee797c.poster.avif?t=1743563490\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183350/extras/ad1f1c308e48fa149c925cb0dcee797c.webm?t=1743563490\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183350/extras/ad1f1c308e48fa149c925cb0dcee797c.mp4?t=1743563490\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 Cultivate your own fry in meticulously designed tanks; as they mature, players can choose to exchange them for gold coins or keep them for regular fixed coin rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183350/extras/10c5cefc8827c13723383b6bf4460fb6.poster.avif?t=1743563490\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183350/extras/10c5cefc8827c13723383b6bf4460fb6.webm?t=1743563490\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183350/extras/10c5cefc8827c13723383b6bf4460fb6.mp4?t=1743563490\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 Unlock various themed fish boxes to discover hidden fish and decorations!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183350/extras/1619b68fa7c71577368b0f4946b0d045.poster.avif?t=1743563490\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183350/extras/1619b68fa7c71577368b0f4946b0d045.webm?t=1743563490\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183350/extras/1619b68fa7c71577368b0f4946b0d045.mp4?t=1743563490\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183350/extras/b127f1ec7fa4283732e9820c65142532.poster.avif?t=1743563490\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183350/extras/b127f1ec7fa4283732e9820c65142532.webm?t=1743563490\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183350/extras/b127f1ec7fa4283732e9820c65142532.mp4?t=1743563490\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 Enjoy a diverse selection of soothing background music with ambient sounds, perfect for unwinding after work or study.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183350/extras/f7bce3362b7f4b9d7ce91bce7f49546a.poster.avif?t=1743563490\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183350/extras/f7bce3362b7f4b9d7ce91bce7f49546a.webm?t=1743563490\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183350/extras/f7bce3362b7f4b9d7ce91bce7f49546a.mp4?t=1743563490\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183350/extras/99cecb1e534f80541c93e2ee9b7a081f.avif?t=1743563490\" width=650 height=438 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fantasy Aquarium is a casual simulation game that offers card pack openings,capsule toys, and other engaging activities. Players collect fish cards to complete their fantasy fish box. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Game Features </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 The adorable Kanban girl is consistently present by your side.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183350/extras/ad1f1c308e48fa149c925cb0dcee797c.poster.avif?t=1743563490\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183350/extras/ad1f1c308e48fa149c925cb0dcee797c.webm?t=1743563490\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183350/extras/ad1f1c308e48fa149c925cb0dcee797c.mp4?t=1743563490\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 Cultivate your own fry in meticulously designed tanks; as they mature, players can choose to exchange them for gold coins or keep them for regular fixed coin rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183350/extras/10c5cefc8827c13723383b6bf4460fb6.poster.avif?t=1743563490\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183350/extras/10c5cefc8827c13723383b6bf4460fb6.webm?t=1743563490\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183350/extras/10c5cefc8827c13723383b6bf4460fb6.mp4?t=1743563490\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 Unlock various themed fish boxes to discover hidden fish and decorations!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183350/extras/1619b68fa7c71577368b0f4946b0d045.poster.avif?t=1743563490\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183350/extras/1619b68fa7c71577368b0f4946b0d045.webm?t=1743563490\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183350/extras/1619b68fa7c71577368b0f4946b0d045.mp4?t=1743563490\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183350/extras/b127f1ec7fa4283732e9820c65142532.poster.avif?t=1743563490\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183350/extras/b127f1ec7fa4283732e9820c65142532.webm?t=1743563490\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183350/extras/b127f1ec7fa4283732e9820c65142532.mp4?t=1743563490\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 Enjoy a diverse selection of soothing background music with ambient sounds, perfect for unwinding after work or study.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183350/extras/f7bce3362b7f4b9d7ce91bce7f49546a.poster.avif?t=1743563490\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183350/extras/f7bce3362b7f4b9d7ce91bce7f49546a.webm?t=1743563490\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183350/extras/f7bce3362b7f4b9d7ce91bce7f49546a.mp4?t=1743563490\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
